{"id":"n87735-1-10","stage":4,"title":"혈액형 · 血型","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87735-1-10-1","ko":"승규야 너는 혈액형이 뭐야?","zh":"承奎，你的血型是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"혈액형이","meaning":"血型","explanation":"혈액형：血型；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"혈액형","audio":"/audio/bd867cc84fff897a11dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87735","senseId":"1","lemma":"혈액형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혈액형이","audio":"/audio/859f9cf3be45919f617f.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bd867cc84fff897a","term":"혈액형","zh":"血型","audio":"/audio/bd867cc84fff897a11dc.mp3","entryId":"87735","definition":"以红血球凝集反应为基础分类的血液类型。","pronunciation":["혀래켱"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/c70706b9aaaa374e79c5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87735-1-10-2","ko":"응, 내 혈액형은 너와 같대.","zh":"嗯，我的血型据说和